{
  "name": "WaySlice — Track Sector Analyzer",
  "short_name": "WaySlice",
  "description": "Telemetry for your way. Sliced. An open-source analyzer which can slice any section of your GPX/KML/KMZ/TCX/FIT activity record and analyze it like reading telemetry. Fully local, nothing is uploaded.",
